#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:1
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:3
msgid ""
"This quickstart takes a fresh clone of HybridInference through three "
"stages on one local gateway:"
msgstr "本快速入门带你把一个全新克隆的 HybridInference 在一个本地网关上走完三个阶段："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:6
msgid "Prove the routing chain with a deterministic fake provider."
msgstr "用一个行为确定的假 provider 验证路由链路。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:7
msgid ""
"Add the Web and Admin Consoles, Postgres, accounts, API keys and request "
"history to the same running Compose project."
msgstr "在同一个运行中的 Compose 项目里加入 Web 控制台和管理控制台、Postgres、账号、API key 和请求记录。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:9
msgid "Replace the fake provider with a local vLLM, SGLang or Ollama server."
msgstr "用本地的 vLLM、SGLang 或 Ollama 服务器替换假 provider。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:11
msgid ""
"The first two stages need no provider account, `.env` file, GPU, SMTP "
"service or paid API key, and CI runs their commands on every change that "
"touches them. To run the gateway from a source checkout against real "
"models instead, see [Installation](installation.md)."
msgstr ""
"前两个阶段不需要 provider 账号、`.env` 文件、GPU、SMTP 服务或付费 API key，CI "
"会在每次涉及它们的改动上运行这些命令。如果想从源码检出运行网关并接入真实模型，见[安装](installation.md)。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:16
msgid "What you need"
msgstr "需要准备什么"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:18
msgid ""
"Docker Engine 24+ with Compose v2 (`docker compose version`) and a "
"running daemon: `docker info` must succeed. On macOS, start Docker "
"Desktop or Colima, and clone into a directory Docker may share with "
"containers."
msgstr ""
"Docker Engine 24+ 和 Compose v2（`docker compose "
"version`），并且守护进程在运行：`docker info` 必须成功。在 macOS 上，先启动 Docker Desktop 或 "
"Colima，并克隆到 Docker 可以共享给容器的目录中。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:21
msgid ""
"Git, curl, GNU Make, and Python 3.11–3.13 (3.12 recommended). The smoke "
"checks use only the standard library."
msgstr "Git、curl、GNU Make 和 Python 3.11–3.13（推荐 3.12）。冒烟检查只用标准库。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:23
msgid "Several GB of free disk."
msgstr "几 GB 的空闲磁盘空间。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:24
msgid ""
"Free loopback ports `18080` (backend), `13001` (frontend) and `15432` "
"(Postgres). Stage 1 uses only `18080`. To use other ports, see [Port "
"already in use](#port-already-in-use)."
msgstr ""
"空闲的回环端口 `18080`（后端）、`13001`（前端）和 `15432`（Postgres）。阶段 1 只用 "
"`18080`。要换用其他端口，见[端口已被占用](#port-already-in-use)。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:28
msgid ""
"Node.js is not needed: the frontend is built in Docker. A GPU is needed "
"only for a GPU-backed server in Stage 3."
msgstr "不需要 Node.js：前端在 Docker 里构建。只有阶段 3 使用 GPU 推理服务器时才需要 GPU。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:31
msgid "Stage 1: prove the router works"
msgstr "阶段 1：确认路由能正常工作"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:33
msgid "Clone the repository and start the example distribution:"
msgstr "克隆仓库并启动示例发行版："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:42
msgid ""
"This starts two containers: `example-provider`, a deterministic OpenAI-"
"compatible upstream, and `backend`, the gateway. Postgres and the "
"frontend stay stopped, and accounts and authentication are off."
msgstr ""
"这会启动两个容器：`example-provider`，一个行为确定的 OpenAI 兼容上游；以及 `backend`，即网关。Postgres"
" 和前端保持停止，账号和鉴权都处于关闭状态。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:46
msgid ""
"Run the automated check. It waits for startup and tests `/health`, "
"`/site-config`, `/v1/models` and a routed completion:"
msgstr "运行自动检查。它会等待启动完成，并测试 `/health`、`/site-config`、`/v1/models` 和一次经过路由的补全请求："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:57
msgid "Inspect the gateway yourself"
msgstr "自己动手检查网关"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:67
msgid ""
"An anonymous caller sees only the status; an administrator also sees the "
"route count and the state of the database (see [Health "
"checks](deployment.md#health-checks))."
msgstr "匿名调用方只能看到状态；管理员还能看到路由数量和数据库状态（见[健康检查](deployment.md#health-checks)）。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:75
msgid ""
"The response lists the public model id `example-chat`. Stage 1 has no "
"database, so the example hands the container its `MODEL_CATALOG` setting "
"as an environment seed, read from "
"`distributions/example/config/models.json`. Normal deployments configure "
"the catalog in Admin. To try a change, edit the model's `name` in that "
"file, run `make up DISTRIBUTION=example` again and list the models; "
"restore the file before Stage 2."
msgstr ""
"响应中列出了对外的模型 id `example-chat`。阶段 1 没有数据库，所以示例把 `MODEL_CATALOG` "
"设置项作为环境变量初始值交给容器，内容读自 `distributions/example/config/models.json`。正常部署在 "
"Admin 中配置模型目录。想试试修改，可以编辑该文件中模型的 `name`，再次运行 `make up "
"DISTRIBUTION=example` 并重新列出模型；进入阶段 2 之前把文件恢复原样。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:82
msgid "Send a completion:"
msgstr "发送一次 completion："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:90
msgid ""
"The assistant replies `RUNNABLE_EXAMPLE_OK`. Only the bundled fake "
"provider sends that reply, so it proves the request went through the "
"gateway's routing: the client asked for `example-chat`, and the route "
"translated that into the provider's own model name."
msgstr ""
"助手回复 `RUNNABLE_EXAMPLE_OK`。只有自带的假 provider 会这样回复，所以这证明请求经过了网关的路由：客户端请求的是 "
"`example-chat`，路由把它转换成了 provider 自己的模型名。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:95
msgid ""
"With `\"stream\":true`, the same answer arrives as "
"`chat.completion.chunk` events ending with `data: [DONE]`:"
msgstr ""
"加上 `\"stream\":true` 后，同样的回答会以 `chat.completion.chunk` 事件流式返回，最后一行是 "
"`data: [DONE]`："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:104
msgid ""
"`curl -s localhost:18080/routing` lists each model's routes with their "
"provider label and weight. Only an administrator also sees each route's "
"upstream URL; see [API endpoints](routing.md#api-endpoints)."
msgstr ""
"`curl -s localhost:18080/routing` 会列出每个模型的路由及其 provider "
"标签和权重。只有管理员还能看到每条路由的上游 URL；见 [API 端点](routing.md#api-endpoints)。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:108
msgid ""
"Leave the stack running and do not run `make down`: Stage 2 extends this "
"Compose project in place."
msgstr "让这套服务保持运行，不要执行 `make down`：阶段 2 会在原地扩展这个 Compose 项目。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:111
msgid "Stage 2: continue into the Web and Admin Consoles"
msgstr "阶段 2：接入 Web 控制台和管理控制台"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:113
msgid ""
"Add Postgres and the frontend, and recreate the backend with "
"authentication on:"
msgstr "加入 Postgres 和前端，并以开启鉴权的方式重建后端："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:120
msgid ""
"The bundled provider keeps running. Postgres starts with a volume of the "
"example's own, the backend is recreated against it, and the frontend "
"starts last. On its first start against the new database, the backend "
"generates the secrets that sign sessions and protect API keys, stores the"
" example's settings, and logs a one-time setup code:"
msgstr ""
"自带的 provider 会继续运行。Postgres "
"启动时使用示例自己的卷，后端针对它重建，前端最后启动。后端第一次连接新数据库启动时，会生成用于签发会话和保护 API key "
"的密钥，保存示例的设置项，并在日志中输出一次性设置码："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:130
msgid ""
"The code stays the same until setup is done and is logged again at every "
"start. Open <http://localhost:13001/setup> (or your own `FRONTEND_PORT`):"
msgstr ""
"设置完成之前，设置码保持不变，并且每次启动都会再次输出。打开 <http://localhost:13001/setup>（或你自己的 "
"`FRONTEND_PORT`）："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:133
msgid ""
"Enter the setup code, then create the administrator with the username "
"`admin` and a demo-only password of at least eight characters with an "
"uppercase letter, a lowercase letter and a number. The account has no "
"email address and signs in with the username. `admin` suits this "
"loopback-only example and the full-stack check below; a real deployment "
"should pick a name that is hard to guess (see [The first admin "
"account](deployment.md#the-first-admin-account))."
msgstr ""
"输入设置码，然后创建管理员：用户名为 "
"`admin`，密码只用于演示，至少八个字符，包含大写字母、小写字母和数字。这个账号没有邮箱地址，用用户名登录。`admin` "
"适合这个只在回环地址上运行的示例和下面的全栈检查；真实部署应选一个不易猜到的名字（见[第一个管理员账号](deployment.md#the-"
"first-admin-account)）。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:140
msgid ""
"The example needs none of the settings the next step offers: select "
"**Save and continue**, then **Finish**. The Admin Console opens on its "
"**Settings** tab, which holds the settings the gateway keeps in its "
"database."
msgstr ""
"下一步提供的设置项，这个示例一个都不需要：选择 **Save and continue**，然后选择 **Finish**。管理控制台会打开 "
"**Settings** 标签页，网关保存在数据库中的设置项都在这里。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:144
msgid ""
"Open **API Keys**, create a key and copy it. **Show key** shows a saved "
"key again later."
msgstr "打开 **API Keys**，创建一个 key 并复制。之后可以用 **Show key** 再次查看已保存的 key。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:146
msgid ""
"Open **Chat**, select `example-chat` and send a message. The reply is "
"`RUNNABLE_EXAMPLE_OK`."
msgstr "打开 **Chat**，选择 `example-chat` 并发送一条消息。回复是 `RUNNABLE_EXAMPLE_OK`。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:149
msgid ""
"Others can now sign up at <http://localhost:13001/signup> as ordinary "
"users; email verification is off in this example. Your account is the "
"administrator because first-run setup created it. The Admin Console's "
"**Providers** and **Routing** tabs add providers, keys and models to a "
"running gateway; see [Runtime configuration from the admin "
"console](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)."
msgstr ""
"现在其他人可以在 <http://localhost:13001/signup> "
"注册为普通用户；这个示例关闭了邮箱验证。你的账号是管理员，因为它是首次运行设置创建的。管理控制台的 **Providers** 和 "
"**Routing** 标签页可以向运行中的网关添加 provider、key "
"和模型；见[在管理控制台中做运行时配置](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-the-"
"admin-console)。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:155
msgid ""
"The console and the API share one origin: the frontend forwards `/v1`, "
"`/auth`, `/user` and `/admin` on port `13001` to the backend "
"(`apps/frontend/next.config.js`). Send an authenticated request with your"
" key:"
msgstr ""
"控制台和 API 共用同一个源：前端把 `13001` 端口上的 `/v1`、`/auth`、`/user` 和 `/admin` "
"转发给后端（`apps/frontend/next.config.js`）。用你的 key 发送一个带鉴权的请求："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:168
msgid ""
"The request appears on the console's **Requests** page after a moment. "
"The **pgAdmin** link in the navigation is not part of this example and "
"works only if you deploy pgAdmin separately."
msgstr ""
"稍等片刻，这个请求就会出现在控制台的 **Requests** 页面上。导航栏中的 **pgAdmin** 链接不属于这个示例，只有单独部署了 "
"pgAdmin 才能使用。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:172
msgid "Run the full-stack check with your password:"
msgstr "用你的密码运行全栈检查："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:183
msgid ""
"The check signs in as `admin`, completing first-run setup itself if you "
"skipped the browser steps. It sends normal and streaming requests through"
" the console's address, exercises the chat playground and the Admin API, "
"confirms that a non-admin user gets `403` from the Admin API, and checks "
"the request history. It then recreates the backend and confirms that the "
"account, its session and the API key still work, because their secrets "
"live in the database. It prints no secrets and does not reset the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"检查会以 `admin` 身份登录，如果你跳过了浏览器中的步骤，它会自己完成首次运行设置。它通过控制台的地址发送普通请求和流式请求，测试对话 "
"playground 和 Admin API，确认非管理员用户访问 Admin API 时得到 "
"`403`，并检查请求记录。然后它重建后端，确认账号、会话和 API key "
"仍然可用，因为它们的密钥保存在数据库中。它不会输出任何密钥，也不会重置数据库。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:191
msgid "Stage 3: replace the fake provider with local inference"
msgstr "阶段 3：把假 provider 换成本地推理"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:193
msgid ""
"Start an OpenAI-compatible server (vLLM, SGLang, Ollama or similar) on "
"the host, listening on an address the backend container can reach, such "
"as `0.0.0.0:8000`; a server bound only to the host's `127.0.0.1` is not "
"reachable. Binding to `0.0.0.0` can expose an unauthenticated model "
"server to your LAN, so restrict the port with a host firewall, or bind a "
"private interface Docker can reach."
msgstr ""
"在宿主机上启动一个 OpenAI 兼容的服务器（vLLM、SGLang、Ollama 或类似服务），监听后端容器能访问到的地址，例如 "
"`0.0.0.0:8000`；只绑定在宿主机 `127.0.0.1` 上的服务器无法访问。绑定到 `0.0.0.0` "
"可能把未鉴权的模型服务器暴露给局域网，所以请用主机防火墙限制该端口，或者绑定一个 Docker 能访问到的私有网卡。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:200
msgid ""
"In the Admin Console, open **Settings**, then **Providers & Routing**, "
"and set these three settings under **Providers**:"
msgstr ""
"在管理控制台中打开 **Settings**，再打开 **Providers & Routing**，在 **Providers** "
"下设置这三个设置项："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md
msgid "Value"
msgstr "取值"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md
msgid "`EXAMPLE_UPSTREAM_BASE_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md
msgid "`http://host.docker.internal:8000/v1`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md
msgid "`EXAMPLE_UPSTREAM_API_KEY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md
msgid "`local-placeholder`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md
msgid "`EXAMPLE_UPSTREAM_MODEL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md
msgid "the model name your server serves"
msgstr "你的服务器提供的模型名"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:209
msgid ""
"Select **Save changes**. The model registry reads these settings only at "
"startup, so a **Restart pending** notice appears: select **Restart "
"backend** and wait for the page to reload (`make demo "
"DISTRIBUTION=example` also works). Clients still request `example-chat`; "
"only the route behind it has changed, and the **Routing** tab shows its "
"new base URL."
msgstr ""
"选择 **Save changes**。模型注册表只在启动时读取这些设置项，所以会出现 **Restart pending** 提示：选择 "
"**Restart backend**，等待页面重新加载（也可以运行 `make demo "
"DISTRIBUTION=example`）。客户端仍然请求 `example-chat`；只有它背后的路由变了，**Routing** "
"标签页会显示新的 base URL。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:215
msgid ""
"Once Stage 2 has run, exporting `EXAMPLE_UPSTREAM_*` in your shell "
"changes nothing: a stored setting wins over the environment, and the "
"Settings tab marks such a variable **Environment ignored**. To return to "
"the bundled provider, select **Reset** on the three settings and restart "
"the backend again."
msgstr ""
"阶段 2 运行之后，在 shell 中导出 `EXAMPLE_UPSTREAM_*` "
"不会有任何作用：已保存的设置项优先于环境变量，Settings 标签页会把这样的变量标记为 **Environment "
"ignored**。要切回自带的 provider，在这三个设置项上选择 **Reset**，再重启一次后端。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:220
msgid ""
"`EXAMPLE_UPSTREAM_API_KEY` is the credential the gateway presents to the "
"provider, not the `HYBRIDINFERENCE_API_KEY` that clients present to the "
"gateway. Test the real model with **Chat** or the authenticated `curl` "
"from Stage 2. Do not run the smoke checks against it: they expect the "
"fake provider's fixed reply."
msgstr ""
"`EXAMPLE_UPSTREAM_API_KEY` 是网关向 provider 出示的凭据，而不是客户端向网关出示的 "
"`HYBRIDINFERENCE_API_KEY`。用 **Chat** 或阶段 2 中带鉴权的 `curl` "
"测试真实模型。不要对它运行冒烟检查：它们期望的是假 provider 的固定回复。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:226
msgid "What the example contains"
msgstr "示例里有什么"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:228
msgid "The example is one [distribution](glossary.md#deployments):"
msgstr "这个示例就是一个[发行版](glossary.md#deployments)："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:247
msgid ""
"`distribution.json` holds Stage 1's site settings, with public signup "
"off; the demo's, with signup on, are the `SITE_CONFIGURATION` in "
"`deploy/docker-compose.demo.yml`. Both stages seed the model catalog and "
"the routing file from `config/`."
msgstr ""
"`distribution.json` 保存阶段 1 的站点设置，关闭了公开注册；演示环境的站点设置开启了注册，是 "
"`deploy/docker-compose.demo.yml` 中的 `SITE_CONFIGURATION`。两个阶段都从 `config/` "
"初始化模型目录和路由文件。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:250
msgid ""
"`docker-compose.yml` adds the fake provider and starts the backend alone."
" `docker-compose.demo.yml` adds Postgres, the console and a database "
"volume of the example's own; the first start copies the settings into "
"that database, where they change from then on. Nothing in the example "
"touches the `hybridinference_postgres_data` volume a real deployment "
"uses."
msgstr ""
"`docker-compose.yml` 加入假 provider，只启动后端。`docker-compose.demo.yml` 加入 "
"Postgres、控制台和示例自己的数据库卷；第一次启动时把设置项复制进这个数据库，此后就在那里修改。示例不会碰真实部署使用的 "
"`hybridinference_postgres_data` 卷。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:255
msgid ""
"`EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` marks the directory as an example, so a plain `make up`"
" never picks it; select it with `DISTRIBUTION=example`."
msgstr ""
"`EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` 把这个目录标记为示例，所以普通的 `make up` 永远不会选中它；用 "
"`DISTRIBUTION=example` 来选择它。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:258
msgid "Where to go next"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:260
msgid ""
"To build your own deployment, copy this directory, delete "
"`EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` and the fake provider, replace every local-only name "
"and secret, and read [Distribution customization](distribution-"
"customization.md)."
msgstr ""
"要搭建你自己的部署，复制这个目录，删除 `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` 和假 "
"provider，替换所有只用于本地的名称和密钥，然后阅读[发行版定制](distribution-customization.md)。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:263
msgid "[Configuration](configuration.md): settings and environment variables."
msgstr "[配置](configuration.md)：设置项和环境变量。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:264
msgid ""
"[Adding a New Model](adding-models.md): a model entry and its `route` "
"list."
msgstr "[添加新模型](adding-models.md)：模型条目及其 `route` 列表。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:265
msgid ""
"[Routing](routing.md): weights, fallback, circuit breaking, affinity and "
"custom strategies."
msgstr "[路由](routing.md)：权重、回退、熔断、会话亲和以及自定义策略。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:267
msgid ""
"[Installation](installation.md): running from a source checkout against "
"real providers."
msgstr "[安装](installation.md)：从源码检出运行网关并接入真实 provider。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:270
msgid "Stop, resume, and reset"
msgstr "停止、恢复与重置"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:272
msgid ""
"After Stage 2 or 3, stop all four services and keep the account, API key,"
" settings and request history:"
msgstr "在阶段 2 或 3 之后，停止全部四个服务，同时保留账号、API key、设置项和请求记录："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:279
msgid ""
"`make demo DISTRIBUTION=example` resumes whichever stage you stopped at. "
"To stop the stack and delete the example's data, including the "
"administrator, the generated secrets and every stored setting:"
msgstr ""
"`make demo DISTRIBUTION=example` "
"会恢复到你停下时所在的阶段。要停止整套服务并删除示例的数据，包括管理员、生成的密钥和所有已保存的设置项："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:287
msgid ""
"The next `make demo` then starts with first-run setup again. `demo-reset`"
" cannot delete the production database volume. If you stop after Stage 1,"
" use `make down DISTRIBUTION=example`."
msgstr ""
"之后的 `make demo` 会重新从首次运行设置开始。`demo-reset` 无法删除生产数据库卷。如果你在阶段 1 之后停止，用 "
"`make down DISTRIBUTION=example`。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:291
msgid ""
"Once Stage 2 has started, do not use `make up DISTRIBUTION=example` to go"
" back to Stage 1: it applies only the Stage 1 Compose files and can leave"
" a mix of services. Run `make demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example` and start "
"again."
msgstr ""
"阶段 2 开始之后，不要用 `make up DISTRIBUTION=example` 退回阶段 1：它只应用阶段 1 的 Compose "
"文件，可能让服务处于混杂状态。运行 `make demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example`，然后重新开始。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:295
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:297
msgid "Port already in use"
msgstr "端口已被占用"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:299
msgid "Pass the same overrides to every command:"
msgstr "在每条命令上都传入同样的覆盖值："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:315
msgid ""
"Then use backend port `28080` in Stage 1 and frontend port `23001` "
"afterwards. The first `make demo` stores the site's links "
"(`SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`, `BASE_URL` and `FRONTEND_URL`, built from "
"`FRONTEND_PORT` in `docker-compose.demo.yml`) in the example's database, "
"so keep the same three ports on every later `make demo` or `make demo-"
"smoke`. A different `FRONTEND_PORT` later does not change the stored "
"links; edit them on the Settings tab, or reset the example."
msgstr ""
"然后在阶段 1 使用后端端口 `28080`，之后使用前端端口 `23001`。第一次 `make demo` "
"会把站点链接（`SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`、`BASE_URL` 和 `FRONTEND_URL`，由 `docker-"
"compose.demo.yml` 根据 `FRONTEND_PORT` 生成）保存到示例的数据库中，所以之后每次运行 `make demo` 或"
" `make demo-smoke` 都要使用同样的三个端口。之后换一个 `FRONTEND_PORT` 不会改变已保存的链接；请在 "
"Settings 标签页上修改，或者重置示例。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:323
msgid "The setup page rejects the code"
msgstr "设置页面不接受设置码"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:325
msgid ""
"Run the `docker logs` command from Stage 2 again and copy the code from "
"the last line; an earlier line may belong to an example database you have"
" since reset. Wrong codes are rate limited, but the right one is always "
"accepted. If the log has no setup code, setup is complete: sign in "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"再次运行阶段 2 中的 `docker logs` "
"命令，复制最后一行中的设置码；更早的行可能属于你已经重置掉的示例数据库。输错设置码会被限流，但正确的设置码总能通过。如果日志里没有设置码，说明设置已经完成：直接登录即可。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:330
msgid ""
"The administrator has no email address, so a forgotten password cannot be"
" reset by mail. Reset it from the command line:"
msgstr "管理员没有邮箱地址，所以忘记密码后无法通过邮件重置。请在命令行中重置："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:338
msgid ""
"It asks for the new password twice and signs the account out everywhere; "
"`--generate` prints a strong password instead."
msgstr "它会让你输入两次新密码，并让该账号在所有地方退出登录；`--generate` 则会生成并输出一个强密码。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:341
msgid "Cannot connect to the Docker daemon"
msgstr "无法连接 Docker daemon"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:343
msgid ""
"Start Docker Desktop or Colima. `docker info` must print a server section"
" before `make up` can work."
msgstr "先启动 Docker Desktop 或 Colima。`docker info` 必须输出 server 部分，`make up` 才能工作。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:346
msgid "Empty `/v1/models`"
msgstr "`/v1/models` 为空"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:348
msgid ""
"In Stage 1, check that you passed `DISTRIBUTION=example` and that the "
"JSON seeds are valid, run `make up DISTRIBUTION=example` again, and read "
"`make logs s=backend DISTRIBUTION=example`. In Stage 2, check the saved "
"and applied configuration in Admin (**Settings** and **Routing**); stored"
" values take precedence over the environment seeds."
msgstr ""
"在阶段 1，确认你传入了 `DISTRIBUTION=example`，并且 JSON 初始配置有效，再次运行 `make up "
"DISTRIBUTION=example`，然后查看 `make logs s=backend DISTRIBUTION=example`。在阶段"
" 2，在 Admin 中（**Settings** 和 **Routing**）检查已保存和已应用的配置；数据库中保存的值优先于环境变量初始值。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:354
msgid "`make up` chose another distribution"
msgstr "`make up` 选中了别的发行版"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:356
msgid ""
"Always pass `DISTRIBUTION=example` in this tutorial. Without it, `make "
"up` uses a real distribution if your checkout has one, never the example."
msgstr ""
"跟着本教程操作时，始终传入 `DISTRIBUTION=example`。不传的话，如果你的检出中有真实发行版，`make up` "
"会使用它，而不会使用示例。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:359
msgid "Start over after a partial run"
msgstr "跑到一半后重新开始"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:361
msgid ""
"Run `make demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example` and begin again at Stage 1. Do"
" not delete Docker volumes by broad name or prune unrelated projects."
msgstr ""
"运行 `make demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example`，然后从阶段 1 重新开始。不要按宽泛的名称删除 Docker "
"卷，也不要清理无关的项目。"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:364
msgid "Inspect a failed service"
msgstr "查看出问题的服务"

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:366
msgid ""
"`make logs DISTRIBUTION=example` follows every running service of the "
"example project. For one service:"
msgstr "`make logs DISTRIBUTION=example` 会跟踪示例项目中所有运行中的服务。只看一个服务："

#: ../developer/router-tutorial.md:373
msgid ""
"Replace `backend` with `frontend`, `postgres` or `example-provider`. "
"Press Ctrl-C to stop following."
msgstr "把 `backend` 换成 `frontend`、`postgres` 或 `example-provider`。按 Ctrl-C 停止跟踪。"
